All services MUST use this exact error response format:

```javascript
// Success Response
{
  "status": "success",
  "data": { /* response data */ },
  "meta": {
    "timestamp": "2024-01-01T00:00:00Z",
    "service": "service-name",
    "version": "1.0.0"
